      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here is some additional information regarding this issue.\n\nThis problem interestingly, may NOT appear on EVERY avatar, assume it only affects the VRC_Stations with specific setup, which is still unclear.\n\nI have trimmed one of my avatars which suffering from this issue and uploaded it as a sample. You may also download the avatar project file to check the setup by yourself. \n\nBe reminded, that this sample setup WORKS in earlier versions, and broke after an update.\n\nAvatar ID: \n\navtr_182de227-c0ab-47a6-a588-bbb7bdce061e \n\n(https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_182de227-c0ab-47a6-a588-bbb7bdce061e)\n\nAvatar Project File: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1U1ISN-USp9nqVO3V42Ratm-wqmOlLs0a/view?usp=drive_link\n\nAvatar Project File MD5: \t\n\na1a2a4b986d5a71dd31192efd6fb9fa3\n\nVirus Total:\n\nhttps://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/d86fbdb7dc011f43595f4b3977dd8c7c065478d0cd21515525c9664be8ffc543/detection",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
