      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update on 2023-10-17 y/m/d:\n\nAfter some tests, I'm sure that this problem is caused by disabling the object with the VRC_Statiotestsn script.\n\nIn previous versions of VRChat, disabling the object with the VRC_Station script will kick the player on the seat off and the seat can be enabled again correctly.\n\nNow, when you disable the object with the VRC_Station script and then enable it again, it won't be able to interact with any player.\n\nTo fix this temporarily, DO NOT DISABLE THE OBJECT WITH THE VRC_STATION, JUST DISABLE THE COLLIDER SCRIPT",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
