      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I ran into this issue as well.  The official documentation suggests that you should animate toggling the collider and the mesh, but not the parent object.  It says toggling the parent object can cause issues.  However, there is no way to kick someone out of a seat if you don't toggle the parent object.  Following the official documentation recommendations results in no way to kick people out of the seat.  Therefore it is not really a solution since it results in lost functionality.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
