      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} Avatar stations generally seem to at least *function* in 2025, so yes, this can be marked as complete.\n\nThough they certainly feel dated and unstable between inconsistencies when attempting to toggle the component (such as the absence of the script toggle checkbox, while its corresponding property can still be found when creating an animation for the station), no longer being able to kick other players out of the seat even if successfully toggled, view offsets/animations breaking when the station isn't perfectly level when entered, etc.",
